{"id":"55d889c1e98eddc1","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-degree-countability.md","title":"度及其下锥的可数性","display":"thm-degree-countability — 度及其下锥的可数性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-degree-countability","aliases":["43-thm-degree-countability"],"display":"thm-degree-countability — 度及其下锥的可数性","depends_on":["[[43-df-dstr]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-degree-countability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-degree-countability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-countability — 度及其下锥的可数性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>为可数基数。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{deg}(A)|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad |\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\le_TA\\}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\mathcal D|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{deg}(A)|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad |\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\le_TA\\}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\mathcal D|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个从A可计算的集合由某个自然数程序编号给出，故其下锥与度可数；连续统个实数被分成可数等价类，故商集基数为连续统。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dstr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-dstr]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-dstr]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{deg}(A)|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad |\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\le_TA\\}|\\le\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\mathcal D|=2^{\\aleph_0}.","display":true}],"bytes":1114,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-degree-countability]] — 度及其下锥的可数性"}],"outgoing":["0857d6ab104a439b","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}